---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
import { AFTER_TRIP } from '../config';
import { valet } from '../data/qa';
import photo from '../assets/photos/cockpit.jpg';
---

<ServicePage
  title="Boat Valet Auckland | Post-trip reset | Shore Leave"
  description="Boat valet in Auckland: deck wash-down, rubbish off, interior vacuumed, beds remade and fridge cleared. Walk off the boat and we'll reset it."
  crumb="Boat valet Auckland"
  h1="Boat valet, Auckland. Done after you've gone."
  lede="A post-trip reset for owners who've had a big day out. You walk off the boat. We clean it, make the beds and clear the fridge."
  photo={photo}
  photoAlt="Cockpit of a motor boat on its berth, seen from above, with tan upholstery and a timber table"
  faqs={valet}
  serviceName="Boat valet and post-trip reset"
  og="valet"
  links={[
    { href: '/book', label: 'Book a reset' },
    { href: '/pricing', label: 'How quotes work' },
    { href: '/pine-harbour-boat-cleaning', label: 'Pine Harbour berths' },
    { href: '/trailer-boat-cleaning', label: 'Trailer boats at home' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="wrap band lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2>What gets done</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">The same list every time, so you know what you're coming back to.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="crosses lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 mt-6 lg:mt-2 text-lg">{AFTER_TRIP.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap pb-16 lg:pb-24 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
    <h2 class="lg:col-span-5">A boat clean up after the trip, not before the next one</h2>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 mt-4 lg:mt-2 grid gap-4">
      <p>Salt, sunscreen, bait and spilled drinks are easier to shift the day after than three weeks later. Most boats sit dirty because nobody has anything left at the end of a weekend. That's normal. It's also why we exist.</p>
      <p>We work on deck and inside the boat. That's the whole job. Book it once after a big trip, or set up a regular reset so the boat is always ready.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServicePage>
